---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Fetch a secret reference from its provider and show it masked

Usage: rustman secret get [OPTIONS] <REFERENCE>

Arguments:
  <REFERENCE>
          The reference: <provider>/<path>[#field]

Options:
      --reveal
          Print the value itself (only when stdout is a terminal)

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
